		{
			dependencies: ["35FE140DAE03BB36"]
			description: [
				"Eight lords rule eight ruins. Each has an &eEye&f: craft it and throw it, and it flies towards its master's hall the way an Eye of Ender finds a stronghold."
				""
				"They are not equals. The book takes them in three courts:"
				"&cThe Outer Court&f - the Netherite Monstrosity, the Ender Guardian and the Ancient Remnant."
				"&4The Inner Court&f - the Harbinger and the Leviathan. Opens after any two of the Outer Court."
				"&5The Throne&f - Ignis, Maledictus and Scylla. Opens after either of the Inner Court."
				""
				"Each lord drops the heart of a set of gear found nowhere else."
				""
				"&7Engineers: the MekaSuit is built around Ignis's armour, and the Digital Miner needs a Nether Star."
			]
			hide_until_deps_complete: true
